WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.460
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.730 --> 00:02.990
What about Cha Dohyun?

3
00:03.340 --> 00:04.270
What?

4
00:04.770 --> 00:06.710
I mean, is he doing well?

5
00:20.420 --> 00:22.820
We broke up.

6
00:26.700 --> 00:27.670
Ah...

7
00:31.360 --> 00:32.880
It's already summer.

8
00:36.410 --> 00:38.540
Why don't you take a shower at my place?

9
00:38.580 --> 00:39.510
What?

10
00:44.520 --> 00:45.660
Hey, Kwon Yihyun.

11
00:46.540 --> 00:48.630
I'm saying this because I'm worried.

12
00:49.110 --> 00:51.170
Don't talk like this to other people.

13
00:51.620 --> 00:52.640
What?

14
00:54.360 --> 00:56.430
I'm saying this 'cause who knows—

15
00:56.910 --> 01:00.520
you didn't... have feelings... for me, right?

16
01:01.120 --> 01:04.530
If you think we can get together just 'cause I broke up with him,

17
01:04.530 --> 01:06.060
it'll put me in a tight spot.

18
01:11.580 --> 01:12.450
Forget it if you're not.

19
01:12.450 --> 01:14.750
Why are you looking at me like that? Jeez.

20
01:21.640 --> 01:22.730
I'm off.

21
01:29.970 --> 01:31.030
Hey, Kwon Yihyun.

22
01:33.810 --> 01:36.509
Those people at the club won't do anything strange

23
01:36.509 --> 01:37.970
like bullying you, right?

24
01:40.310 --> 01:41.410
No.

25
01:45.190 --> 01:46.380
That's good enough.

26
01:48.080 --> 01:49.150
I'm off for real.

27
02:26.350 --> 02:29.060
[Sung Inho]

28
02:34.000 --> 02:35.600
[Kim Domin]

29
02:52.040 --> 02:58.160
[Summertime]

30
03:07.060 --> 03:12.490
[3 months ago]

31
03:33.050 --> 03:34.910
[Cha Dohyun]

32
03:46.210 --> 03:48.040
Do you know where this is?

33
03:48.210 --> 03:49.670
Just go in that direction.

34
03:50.550 --> 03:51.470
Thank you.

35
04:32.420 --> 04:33.820
Cha Dohyun, I'm here.

36
04:34.270 --> 04:36.340
The drinking snacks are here!

37
04:44.090 --> 04:46.990
Oh... It's Yeo Eunho.

38
04:50.250 --> 04:51.070
Here.

39
04:56.240 --> 04:57.220
Who's this?

40
04:57.790 --> 04:58.750
Someone you know?

41
04:58.750 --> 04:59.510
Yeah,

42
05:00.020 --> 05:02.080
he's my favorite person in the world.

43
05:02.360 --> 05:05.140
What? You have someone like that?

44
05:07.090 --> 05:09.930
Hello, I'm Dohyun's friend in the same major.

45
05:15.810 --> 05:16.920
I'll get going.

46
05:18.220 --> 05:19.510
Hey, Cha Dohyun!

47
05:20.470 --> 05:21.460
Darn it.

48
05:21.620 --> 05:23.560
You're a freshman, don't you know your place?

49
05:23.560 --> 05:28.440
How dare you leave when your seniors are here?

50
05:29.880 --> 05:32.159
Hey, come back later.

51
05:33.690 --> 05:35.490
I want to leave.

52
05:36.130 --> 05:37.710
Do I need a reason not to leave?

53
05:37.710 --> 05:39.110
What did this rascal say?

54
05:39.620 --> 05:40.420
You're drunk.

55
05:40.550 --> 05:41.470
Don't stop me!

56
05:41.570 --> 05:43.010
I'm not drunk, darn it!

57
05:43.060 --> 05:44.880
He always looks down on me.

58
05:45.010 --> 05:45.870
Feels damn ass!

59
05:46.100 --> 05:48.409
Let go of me!

60
05:48.480 --> 05:50.010
What are you doing? Just go!

61
06:07.020 --> 06:09.490
Where are you? Why did you leave alone?

62
06:12.070 --> 06:14.110
What? Managed to leave?

63
06:14.460 --> 06:15.390
Yes.

64
06:17.090 --> 06:18.930
Who was that?

65
06:20.420 --> 06:21.870
The class representative.

66
06:21.870 --> 06:24.130
He went to the military as soon as he got into college.

67
06:24.130 --> 06:25.880
It's his first semester back.

68
06:26.050 --> 06:27.460
He was probably drunk.

69
06:29.560 --> 06:31.300
Isn't that your senior?

70
06:31.890 --> 06:33.190
Of course.

71
06:35.340 --> 06:38.210
Don't be like that. It's not too late. Go back.

72
06:38.480 --> 06:40.250
If you offend those old brats,

73
06:40.470 --> 06:42.280
you'll be the one to suffer.

74
06:43.960 --> 06:46.159
I put the side dishes in the fridge.

75
06:47.150 --> 06:48.900
Don’t drink too much.

76
06:51.840 --> 06:55.700
Eunho. Seems like you don't miss me that much.

77
06:56.850 --> 06:57.800
What?

78
06:57.940 --> 07:00.600
You've been saying you're busy and tired lately.

79
07:00.600 --> 07:03.150
We haven't seen each other for a long time.

80
07:06.920 --> 07:08.410
Are you drunk?

81
07:09.050 --> 07:11.300
Is that all you can say?

82
07:15.590 --> 07:18.410
Hey. I'm just worried that you offend your senior.

83
07:18.660 --> 07:21.150
What's more, make it clear.

84
07:21.410 --> 07:23.940
People might think we haven't met for months.

85
07:24.220 --> 07:26.070
It's only been 4 days. Four!

86
07:26.600 --> 07:27.850
So?

87
07:28.220 --> 07:29.720
We met 4 days ago,

88
07:29.850 --> 07:32.800
so it's fine that we don't see each other?

89
07:33.040 --> 07:34.080
Fine.

90
07:34.350 --> 07:37.070
I'm sorry I was too busy. Darn it, are you satisfied now?

91
07:37.070 --> 07:39.420
It's all my fault, okay?

92
07:39.980 --> 07:40.980
Bye.

93
07:58.570 --> 08:00.220
I'll get this too.

94
07:59.320 --> 08:00.510
[Hangover drink]

95
08:01.550 --> 08:02.990
It's 8,700 won.

96
08:06.080 --> 08:07.320
[Condom]

97
08:06.340 --> 08:06.940
Excuse me,

98
08:07.080 --> 08:09.680
-I'm the one here first... -We'll get this too.

99
08:11.310 --> 08:13.280
What? Why are you here?

100
08:13.710 --> 08:15.440
'Cause you said you were sorry.

101
08:15.840 --> 08:16.910
What?

102
08:17.130 --> 08:19.100
So I came to accept your apology.

103
08:21.500 --> 08:23.160
Do you want to pay for this too?

104
08:24.220 --> 08:26.310
No, we don't know each other.

105
08:46.480 --> 08:47.330
Hey.

106
08:48.570 --> 08:50.570
Is it fun to tease me?

107
08:51.030 --> 08:53.970
I don't like to tease you.

108
08:54.100 --> 08:55.870
I like you.

109
08:56.520 --> 08:57.700
Sweet-talker.

110
09:06.800 --> 09:08.800
Mom worked so hard.

111
09:10.400 --> 09:13.040
Tell her we'll visit her next week.

112
09:13.180 --> 09:14.940
Aren't you her son?

113
09:15.070 --> 09:17.130
Call her yourself, you unfilial son.

114
09:19.830 --> 09:23.760
What's all this? Why did you buy so much?

115
09:23.940 --> 09:26.170
It's all for me. Don't touch it.

116
09:26.310 --> 09:28.030
I'll kill you if you eat any.

117
09:29.090 --> 09:30.090
Fine.

118
09:35.760 --> 09:37.000
But...

119
09:37.980 --> 09:39.720
Can I eat something else?

120
09:40.250 --> 09:41.510
Again?

121
09:43.970 --> 09:45.120
The class representative

122
09:45.120 --> 09:47.850
poured soju in a beer cup and told me to drink it up.

123
09:48.270 --> 09:50.730
Stop it. You're sweating.

124
09:50.970 --> 09:52.370
I gave him some suggestions

125
09:52.370 --> 09:55.290
for one of our group assignments this time, so he might be picking me

126
09:55.290 --> 09:57.040
cause I ticked him off.

127
09:57.290 --> 09:58.820
It’s so annoying, Eunho.

128
09:58.880 --> 10:00.340
So what do you want me to do?

129
10:00.820 --> 10:02.250
Can you comfort me today?

130
10:02.990 --> 10:04.080
What?

131
10:04.720 --> 10:06.250
Let's shower together.

132
10:09.130 --> 10:10.960
No, I'm tired.

133
10:11.110 --> 10:12.830
Then just stay still.

134
10:30.310 --> 10:31.540
Stop it.

135
10:43.160 --> 10:44.380
Touch me too.

136
12:05.420 --> 12:08.030
[Forum]

137
12:11.220 --> 12:13.730
[I saw a handsome guy smoking at the business administration building.]

138
12:15.870 --> 12:18.920
[I wanted to chat him up by asking him for fire but he gave me the lighter straight. Seriously speaking: he wants to marry me, right?]

139
12:18.930 --> 12:22.720
[I wanted to ask for his phone number, but he left picking up a phone call all smiles.]

140
12:22.730 --> 12:26.010
[Since he was at the business administration building, that must be his major right? I'm going to camp there for him starting today.]

141
12:27.330 --> 12:28.390
[204 replies]

142
12:28.510 --> 12:31.100
[Anonymous 1: I'm sure he has a girlfriend.]

143
12:31.100 --> 12:34.290
[Anonymous 2: There's only one person they can be talking about if it's business administration.]

144
12:34.290 --> 12:37.380
[Anonymous 3: I'm from another department, but I can guess who it is. There has been so many posts like this since school started.]

145
12:37.380 --> 12:38.070
[Anonymous 4: Haha, my friend already got his number.]

146
12:49.970 --> 12:53.990
[Messages] [Yeo Eunho: Where are you?]

147
12:53.990 --> 12:56.740
[Kim Minhyuk: Dohyon, do you wanna meet my friend?] [Seo Taeyoung: My friend asked me for your number.]

148
12:56.740 --> 12:58.960
[Nam Soo-a: Do you want to go on a blind date?] [Ji Soyeon: Dohyun, my friend says she's interested in you.]

149
13:06.490 --> 13:08.350
What are you going to do tomorrow?

150
13:09.010 --> 13:10.960
To help out at my parents' place.

151
13:11.380 --> 13:13.040
Then I won't see you tomorrow?

152
13:13.440 --> 13:14.120
Mm.

153
13:14.390 --> 13:15.330
Why?

154
13:16.300 --> 13:17.830
Can't we meet tomorrow too?

155
13:18.360 --> 13:19.430
No.

156
13:37.340 --> 13:38.420
Well,

157
13:39.750 --> 13:42.360
the girl who flirted with you when you were smoking,

158
13:42.360 --> 13:43.500
was she pretty?

159
13:46.570 --> 13:48.170
Seems like she was your type.

160
13:48.210 --> 13:49.910
You even gave her a lighter.

161
13:52.510 --> 13:53.390
Eunho.

162
13:53.880 --> 13:54.660
What?

163
13:55.240 --> 13:56.560
Are you jealous?

164
13:58.100 --> 14:00.010
I was just asking.

165
14:02.930 --> 14:04.390
I'm not jealous.

166
14:09.920 --> 14:11.720
I didn't want to keep a lighter someone else has touched,

167
14:11.720 --> 14:13.250
so I gave it to her.

168
14:15.180 --> 14:17.350
How can you still not know what my type is?

169
14:17.350 --> 14:18.240
Hmm?

170
14:22.500 --> 14:24.630
Should I tell you while washing you up?

171
14:25.970 --> 14:27.820
Just sleep, you pervert.

172
14:41.860 --> 14:42.970
Dohyun.

173
14:43.730 --> 14:44.630
Hmm?

174
14:47.030 --> 14:49.440
You're the only one I like.

175
14:52.060 --> 14:55.600
What? Are you confessing?

176
14:56.850 --> 15:01.750
You like a lot of things, and you're very capable.

177
15:11.250 --> 15:13.100
Don't worry.

178
15:14.280 --> 15:16.110
I only have you.

179
15:36.190 --> 15:37.630
Check please!

180
15:38.230 --> 15:41.000
Okay, I'll get you your check.

181
15:41.940 --> 15:43.750
Which table is it?

182
15:43.910 --> 15:45.190
The one over there.

183
15:46.810 --> 15:47.790
Over there.

184
15:57.370 --> 15:58.570
Do you need a receipt?

185
15:58.600 --> 16:00.050
The meat is burning!

186
16:00.430 --> 16:01.640
Hold on.

187
16:02.670 --> 16:03.670
Please excuse me.

188
16:11.220 --> 16:12.530
Sorry.

189
16:13.200 --> 16:15.310
I'll get you a new plate of meat.

190
16:34.170 --> 16:35.090
Here's your beer.

191
16:35.090 --> 16:37.310
I wanted soju.

192
16:38.220 --> 16:41.710
I'm sorry. I'll get it right away.

193
17:02.660 --> 17:07.420
[Missed call: Cha Dohyun]

194
17:13.050 --> 17:16.579
Please leave a message after the tone.

195
17:16.859 --> 17:17.650
After...

196
17:28.670 --> 17:32.800
[Cha Dohyun: Done with my day. Arrived at our stay!]

197
17:42.500 --> 17:43.990
Eunho, charcoal!

198
17:44.690 --> 17:47.600
Okay. Coming.

199
17:49.210 --> 17:50.210
Smells good.

200
17:50.380 --> 17:51.320
-It smells good, right? -Yes.

201
17:51.320 --> 17:52.650
Jihyun made all of them.

202
17:52.680 --> 17:54.530
I just cut the vegetables.

203
17:54.660 --> 17:56.340
That's everything.

204
17:57.340 --> 17:58.270
Where's Dohyun?

205
17:58.430 --> 18:01.200
He said he'll be late cause he has student council meeting.

206
18:01.200 --> 18:02.130
Let's eat first.

207
18:02.140 --> 18:03.330
-Okay. -All right.

208
18:03.630 --> 18:05.440
Yeo Eunho, come out!

209
18:10.240 --> 18:12.530
Is Dohyun the year representative?

210
18:12.910 --> 18:13.850
Yes.

211
18:14.830 --> 18:17.160
I heard he got a scholarship too.

212
18:17.650 --> 18:18.630
Yes.

213
18:18.770 --> 18:20.430
If you become an intern in sophomore year,

214
18:20.430 --> 18:23.430
you can go straight to the company after you graduate.

215
18:23.520 --> 18:26.960
Dohyun has nothing to worry about.

216
18:28.150 --> 18:29.430
What about Eunho?

217
18:29.880 --> 18:31.470
What have you been up to lately?

218
18:31.470 --> 18:34.100
He's been helping out at the store.

219
18:35.320 --> 18:38.290
You're helping your parents— that's amazing.

220
18:39.550 --> 18:41.000
It's nothing much.

221
18:42.150 --> 18:44.260
What did you like again?

222
18:44.500 --> 18:46.700
What was your dream when you were young?

223
18:47.350 --> 18:49.220
He has to take over this shop.

224
18:53.270 --> 18:54.430
Why?

225
18:57.350 --> 18:58.280
What?

226
18:58.770 --> 19:02.050
You never asked me if I wanted to take over.

227
19:02.490 --> 19:05.160
What are you going to do if not that?

228
19:05.810 --> 19:07.990
Do you have other plans?

229
19:10.900 --> 19:11.730
Well,

230
19:11.850 --> 19:14.460
kids at his age must have a lot they want to do.

231
19:14.570 --> 19:16.710
That's why he doesn't know what he wants to do.

232
19:16.710 --> 19:19.050
You'll get used to it doing it.

233
19:19.180 --> 19:21.440
It makes you feel like this is your dream.

234
19:27.820 --> 19:29.050
Goodbye.

235
19:33.110 --> 19:34.170
Welcome...

236
19:37.340 --> 19:39.750
My son! You're here.

237
19:43.250 --> 19:45.110
These are my college classmates.

238
19:45.260 --> 19:46.660
This is my mom. Say hello.

239
19:46.700 --> 19:47.730
Hello.

240
19:47.960 --> 19:49.390
Welcome.

241
19:50.420 --> 19:51.360
Eunho.

242
19:51.700 --> 19:52.940
Set up the tableware.

243
19:56.200 --> 19:57.160
Oh!

244
19:58.060 --> 19:59.920
You're that deliveryman, right?

245
20:01.200 --> 20:03.460
You met him in front of the major activity room that day, right?

246
20:03.460 --> 20:05.220
He's my favorite friend.

247
20:13.300 --> 20:15.230
You've got something on your face.

248
20:58.640 --> 21:01.890
I'm sorry. Sorry.

249
21:09.120 --> 21:12.820
What? For what?

250
21:16.040 --> 21:17.860
For everything.

251
21:25.110 --> 21:26.550
Seems like you saw

252
21:26.700 --> 21:27.770
how embarrassed I was.

253
21:27.770 --> 21:29.230
Eunho, it’s not like that.

254
21:30.810 --> 21:32.310
Whether it's back in school or now,

255
21:32.310 --> 21:33.110
when I'm with you,

256
21:33.110 --> 21:34.750
I'm always the worse off one.

257
21:35.850 --> 21:37.440
It was already enough that you got me to go to your school.

258
21:37.440 --> 21:39.370
Why do you have to come to the store?

259
21:40.420 --> 21:41.910
I'm sorry.

260
21:42.460 --> 21:44.670
This was thoughtless of me.

261
21:45.170 --> 21:47.760
I came here cause I just

262
21:48.040 --> 21:50.790
wanted to see you, no matter what.

263
21:52.570 --> 21:54.260
You selfish jerk.

264
21:55.040 --> 21:56.740
You're always

265
21:56.880 --> 21:58.880
so selfish.

266
21:59.660 --> 22:00.300
Yeo Eunho.

267
22:00.390 --> 22:02.190
Just find someone as good as you.

268
22:02.330 --> 22:04.830
I never thought that way.

269
22:05.090 --> 22:09.120
I know you did nothing wrong.

270
22:10.570 --> 22:12.880
It's my fault.

271
22:25.940 --> 22:27.530
Let's stop here.

272
22:31.820 --> 22:33.570
What did you say?

273
22:42.300 --> 22:45.380
I said let's break up.

274
23:00.220 --> 23:06.700
[Summertime]

275
23:08.220 --> 23:10.840
I said let's break up.

276
23:16.470 --> 23:17.750
By the way, Eunho.

277
23:17.880 --> 23:19.890
A part-timer is joining tomorrow.

278
23:19.920 --> 23:20.820
A part-timer?

279
23:21.050 --> 23:22.150
Who?

280
23:23.150 --> 23:24.870
He's going to do it for just a month.

281
23:24.870 --> 23:27.730
You have to do it lightly so it doesn't look unfresh.

282
23:32.640 --> 23:34.560
What? Not going to work?

283
23:34.950 --> 23:36.880
I have something to say, Yeo Eunho.

284
23:39.010 --> 23:41.600
Do we have anything to say to each other?

285
23:42.120 --> 23:43.110
I'm off.

286
23:50.650 --> 23:52.110
Yeo Eunho, come out.

287
23:53.300 --> 23:55.270
I'm dying from the heat, so come out.
